# Everything else has a script default or is derived from PF_PUBLIC_HOSTNAME
# (issuer, JWKS URL, token-endpoint audience) or from your AWS session
# (the agent client_id = the agent IAM role ARN). Operator-level credentials
# (Ping DevOps user/key for the license) come from the cluster's devops-secret
# or your environment. The PF hostname follows the standard ping-devops
# convention (<release>-pingfederate-engine.ping-devops.com, wildcard TLS on
# the public nginx controller) — override PF_PUBLIC_HOSTNAME only to deviate.

# AWS region for the agent deployment (aws/setup-identity.sh, agentcore CLI).
AWS_REGION=eu-central-1
